# ZEN_SPEC.md section 11.9. Copy to `key.properties` beside this file and fill in.
#
# `key.properties` and the keystore it points at are gitignored and MUST NOT be
# committed. Losing them is the one irreversible operational mistake available
# in this project: a future release can no longer upgrade an existing install in
# place, and the only way to install it is to uninstall first, which destroys
# the local database -- every Idea, every Task, and the LAN pairing keys.
#
# Back the keystore and these passwords up somewhere off this machine before
# cutting a release. MANUAL_VERIFICATION.md, section "M8 -- the keystore", has
# the keytool command and the backup step.
#
# `storeFile` is resolved relative to packages/zen_app/android/. An absolute
# path outside the repository is preferable -- it keeps the keystore from ever
# being committed by accident.

storeFile=C:/path/to/zen-release.jks
storePassword=
keyAlias=zen
keyPassword=
